// Form-native DeepSeek-V4 measurement: prefill, requested decode steps, actual
// dispatch/host/device costs and validation against the retained recording.
// Empty stdin, {} or {"dry":1} reads the plan without mapping or taking a lease.
// {"go":1} runs it. Options include file, cap, steps, watch, arena_slots,
// prompt_ids, logits, teacher, attribute, receipt and the host options printed
// by the plan. pct remains legacy receipt metadata; resource attention follows
// measured capacity and allocation growth without percentage or time quotas.
// A session owns its lease before admission and retains incomplete release,
// receipt publication or validation for the next call to resume. Completion of
// generation, validation_complete and release_ok remain separate receipt facts.
// Exit 0 requires completed work, completed validation, release and a retained
// receipt; other outcomes retain their original reason and completed effects.

// preflight-exec: forbidden
// preludes: form-stdlib/bml/dsv4-token-run.bml
section [form.bml] {
 dtr-main();
}
